  "title": {
    "zh": "刚好装满的模块盒",
    "en": "Exact-Fill Module Cartridges"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "整机需要 51 块模块，机内已有 8 块。仓库只发整盒，长盒每盒 7 块且最多 6 盒，短盒每盒 4 块且最多 10 盒。必须刚好补足，并让发出的总盒数最少。每个长盒配 2 个支座，每个短盒配 1 个固定带；每盒各贴 1 张物流签。散件和空盒留库。审核 AI 的最少盒数方案。",
    "en": "The machine needs 51 modules and already holds 8. The depot ships sealed cartridges. A long cartridge holds 7 modules, with at most 6 available. A short one holds 4, with at most 10 available. Fill the exact gap with the fewest cartridges. Each long cartridge needs two cradle blocks and each short one needs one strap. Each cartridge gets one shipping label. Loose modules and empty cartons stay behind. Audit the minimum-cartridge proposal."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "整数配额、最少包装与配件联动",
    "en": "Exact integer quotas, minimum packing and matching accessories"
  },
